Daily Security Checklist
The team should ask these questions during every review:
Is this data necessary?
Is consent captured?
Is child data involved?
Is parent/guardian consent required?
Is the API protected?
Is role permission checked?
Is school-level isolation checked?
Is the file private?
Is sensitive data logged?
Is data shared with a third party?
Is the data encrypted or protected?
Is there a deletion/retention process?
